        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Don't just to conclusions, Silverleaf.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  There's no links and there's no out-of-place comments. Could just be a new-comer with lesser English skills.Welcome KuroSoul19! (Pleasedon'tbeabot…)&nbsp;<span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p><span>There was a link when I posted. A link with unrelated text in a super-generic post from a brand new user is spam 99 times out of 100.</span></p>\n<p><span>I apologise if that's not the case here.</span></p>",
