        "created_at": "2015-04-25T07:51:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Awww, and here I was excited about new activity in the GSF section of the forums...<br><br><br>Wish more people were open to discussion about this game. &nbsp;Honestly I play this game more often than Sentinels and wish there was more community support for it. &nbsp;But it almost feels as if everyone is just kind of sweeping it under the rug.</p>",
